WEBVTT

01:26.200 --> 01:31.590
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.190 --> 01:39.590
[Episode 19 The Die Is Cast]

01:54.880 --> 01:56.486
Four to one.

01:56.510 --> 01:58.556
15 bets.

01:58.580 --> 02:00.826
2,200 taels were bet.

02:00.850 --> 02:03.190
We need to pay 8,800 taels.

02:03.870 --> 02:05.426
Five to one.

02:05.450 --> 02:07.016
17 bets.

02:07.040 --> 02:09.636
3,050 taels were bet.

02:09.660 --> 02:11.286
We need to pay…

02:11.310 --> 02:12.386
Just give me the total number.

02:12.410 --> 02:13.626
No way.

02:13.650 --> 02:14.786
After paying Mr. Yun,

02:14.810 --> 02:16.490
it's time to pay us.

02:22.340 --> 02:23.790
Coming through.

02:35.800 --> 02:37.250
Sit.

02:43.140 --> 02:45.726
I've been wondering

02:45.750 --> 02:48.010
where you got the nerve

02:48.030 --> 02:49.406
to put so much money at stake.

02:49.430 --> 02:52.926
It turns out you got such a rich sponsor to back you up.

02:52.950 --> 02:54.816
Mr. Tang, you're wrong.

02:54.840 --> 02:56.530
It's just business.

02:56.830 --> 02:59.146
Guanghui Bank just gave Mr. Yun a loan.

02:59.170 --> 03:01.280
That's what banks do.

03:01.400 --> 03:02.850
Besides,

03:02.910 --> 03:04.686
you run a gambling house.

03:04.710 --> 03:05.950
Where your customer got his money

03:05.950 --> 03:08.470
shouldn't be your concern.

03:09.150 --> 03:10.600
Are you done calculating?

03:12.090 --> 03:15.036
A total of 17,700 taels were bet.

03:15.060 --> 03:16.416
W-We need to pay

03:16.440 --> 03:18.586
75,300 taels.

03:18.610 --> 03:19.826
Manager Qi,

03:19.850 --> 03:21.700
you seem to have missed a bet.

03:22.320 --> 03:25.616
I bet 10,000 taels more before all bets were closed.

03:25.640 --> 03:27.180
Seven to one.

03:27.460 --> 03:29.500
You should pay me

03:29.540 --> 03:31.859
145,300 taels in total.

03:31.950 --> 03:34.230
No more wagers should be accepted then.

03:34.800 --> 03:36.900
Be a good sport.

03:37.210 --> 03:40.406
Don't lose your cool just because of a bet.

03:40.430 --> 03:41.246
Yes.

03:41.270 --> 03:42.686
You started it.

03:42.710 --> 03:44.526
Who'd have known Mr. Tang is a deadbeat?

03:44.550 --> 03:45.030
Right?

03:45.030 --> 03:46.366
Yes.

03:46.390 --> 03:47.136
Mr. Tang,

03:47.160 --> 03:49.666
we also owe more than 50,000 taels of silver to the other gamblers.

03:49.690 --> 03:52.490
We don't have much silver left.

04:09.630 --> 04:11.086
Since we're in the same business,

04:11.110 --> 04:13.070
I don't mind taking a step back.

04:14.190 --> 04:15.640
Mr. Tang.

04:16.219 --> 04:17.850
You can pay me those 70,000 taels

04:18.229 --> 04:20.429
with three things.

04:21.370 --> 04:22.556
First,

04:22.580 --> 04:25.120
according to the contract,

04:25.590 --> 04:27.610
I lost and should be a slave to the Tang family.

04:27.670 --> 04:29.726
I wonder

04:29.750 --> 04:32.110
if you still want me to be your slave now.

04:37.770 --> 04:39.630
[Contract]

04:49.410 --> 04:50.860
Good.

04:51.220 --> 04:52.670
Second,

04:53.130 --> 04:55.120
I need you to release Ten Taels of Gold.

04:55.980 --> 04:57.766
I want him to be unscathed.

04:57.790 --> 04:59.216
You have to pay 10,000 taels

04:59.240 --> 05:00.720
for each wound on him.

05:02.730 --> 05:04.290
I can let him go,

05:04.460 --> 05:06.350
but I have no money to pay you.

05:06.390 --> 05:07.840
Okay.

05:11.990 --> 05:13.440
Third,

05:14.020 --> 05:15.176
my manager Miss Ke

05:15.200 --> 05:17.350
has sent you the message as planned.

05:17.940 --> 05:19.696
Have you prepared the document

05:19.720 --> 05:21.170
that elevates her out of the lowly status?

05:26.370 --> 05:27.820
Yes.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.936
And the antidote to Heart Devouring Powder.

05:32.960 --> 05:34.410
Tianhu needs it.

05:34.670 --> 05:37.070
You'll speak when spoken to, stupid woman!

05:37.220 --> 05:38.606
You said three things.

05:38.630 --> 05:40.466
That's four.

05:40.490 --> 05:42.150
You can refuse,

05:42.390 --> 05:44.446
but I'll take the people outside

05:44.470 --> 05:46.990
to your basement in the backyard

05:47.120 --> 05:49.806
and show them what the famous Mr. Tang

05:49.830 --> 05:52.590
enjoys doing when no one is watching.

06:07.910 --> 06:09.360
Step aside.

06:10.340 --> 06:11.196
It's fine.

06:11.220 --> 06:12.670
Let her in.

06:15.550 --> 06:17.000
Miss Shu.

06:17.710 --> 06:18.966
There are many traps down there.

06:18.990 --> 06:21.350
You'd better stay here.

06:26.260 --> 06:28.326
If anything happened to Ten Taels of Gold,

06:28.350 --> 06:29.990
I'd make you pay with your lives.

06:39.210 --> 06:40.766
You know what's going on down there.

06:40.790 --> 06:41.926
You're a woman too.

06:41.950 --> 06:43.600
Why would you work for him?

06:46.330 --> 06:47.920
Are you under his control as well?

06:48.299 --> 06:49.939
I need something from him.

06:51.420 --> 06:54.200
I heard you can't feel pain and are immune to poison.

06:54.250 --> 06:56.116
You must need some secret medicine

06:56.140 --> 06:58.439
to stay that way.

06:58.740 --> 07:01.480
Is that your deal with Tang Xiao?

07:01.670 --> 07:03.790
Do you know the consequence of working for a scoundrel?

07:07.350 --> 07:09.230
The strong don't fear consequences.

07:09.830 --> 07:11.280
The weak,

07:11.870 --> 07:15.870
like those women down there, only deserve to grovel.

07:17.640 --> 07:19.760
You're just as hopeless as Tang Xiao.

07:19.790 --> 07:21.860
I'll kill him one day.

07:23.110 --> 07:26.570
Before that, I'll kill you.

07:41.790 --> 07:43.689
Those 70,000 taels are written off,

07:44.370 --> 07:46.650
but you still need to pay me 75,300 taels.

07:47.549 --> 07:49.610
When can you give them to me?

07:51.390 --> 07:54.316
Or do you need more time?

07:54.340 --> 07:55.775
Young Master Xiang,

07:55.799 --> 07:58.206
you're really a madman.

07:58.230 --> 07:59.476
Why?

07:59.500 --> 08:02.920
When it comes to gambling,

08:03.030 --> 08:04.486
one should only place a bet

08:04.510 --> 08:06.766
when winning is a sure thing.

08:06.790 --> 08:08.206
But look at you.

08:08.230 --> 08:09.556
You did

08:09.580 --> 08:11.306
the opposite.

08:11.330 --> 08:13.646
You stood to lose

08:13.670 --> 08:15.630
and tricked me into the game.

08:15.710 --> 08:19.230
Both of us ended with great losses.

08:19.450 --> 08:20.900
Young Master Xiang.

08:21.090 --> 08:22.966
You look so composed now,

08:22.990 --> 08:24.296
but have you ever calculated

08:24.320 --> 08:27.660
how much money Liansheng House lost this time?

08:28.000 --> 08:29.910
No matter how much Liansheng House lost,

08:30.220 --> 08:32.240
Guanghui Bank will cover it.

08:33.150 --> 08:35.760
But I bet the money in your account

08:36.220 --> 08:37.720
belongs to someone you answer to.

08:38.590 --> 08:41.110
You have to take so much money out this time.

08:41.549 --> 08:44.069
How will you explain things to the person behind you?

08:44.580 --> 08:45.830
What on earth has Qi Tianfeng

08:45.850 --> 08:48.440
told you about me?

08:48.860 --> 08:50.580
What he said doesn't matter.

08:50.670 --> 08:52.120
What matters

08:52.540 --> 08:55.180
is how many secrets you're keeping.

08:55.540 --> 08:57.286
To keep those secrets,

08:57.310 --> 08:59.500
you pitted yourself against me and risked everything you have.

09:00.490 --> 09:02.320
The secrets I want to know

09:02.570 --> 09:04.606
don't include you joining hands with Qi Tianfeng

09:04.630 --> 09:06.100
to kill Wen Cong,

09:06.510 --> 09:09.790
or you colluding with the Lingyuan Sect secretly.

09:13.830 --> 09:15.446
We may be eavesdropped here.

09:15.470 --> 09:16.920
How about this?

09:17.190 --> 09:20.520
Let's meet at Shangxin Pavilion tomorrow at 3 p.m.

09:21.640 --> 09:24.440
If you show up on time,

09:24.590 --> 09:26.490
I can give you more time

09:26.810 --> 09:28.750
to collect those 75,300 taels.

09:37.500 --> 09:39.440
You just said one should only bet

09:39.850 --> 09:42.730
when winning is a sure thing.

09:43.580 --> 09:45.230
But let me tell you.

09:45.850 --> 09:48.150
The best way to win

09:48.630 --> 09:50.400
is through losing.

09:51.130 --> 09:52.800
With despair comes hope.

10:03.460 --> 10:04.566
Move.

10:04.590 --> 10:06.040
Jin.

10:06.780 --> 10:08.230
Leave him alone.

10:11.470 --> 10:12.920
The key.

10:18.280 --> 10:19.730
Where is my sword?

10:20.800 --> 10:22.250
Let's go back first.

10:22.560 --> 10:23.456
I can't wait.

10:23.480 --> 10:26.210
Then let's settle the scores here.

10:27.750 --> 10:29.200
Bring it on.

10:30.500 --> 10:32.470
There's no rush, Jin.

10:32.690 --> 10:34.340
They're scumbags.

10:34.390 --> 10:36.470
The fact that they're still breathing sickens me.

10:36.800 --> 10:38.206
I'm with you.

10:38.230 --> 10:39.830
But think about Tianhu.

10:41.070 --> 10:42.846
The poison could kill her at any time.

10:42.870 --> 10:44.136
I've got the antidote.

10:44.160 --> 10:45.920
Let's send her the antidote first.

10:46.990 --> 10:48.440
Let's go.

10:57.330 --> 10:59.536
If it weren't for Tianhu,

10:59.560 --> 11:02.626
I'd tear that pest Tang Xiao into pieces

11:02.650 --> 11:04.286
before going back.

11:04.310 --> 11:05.760
Calm down, Jin.

11:05.830 --> 11:08.086
It doesn't hurt to let him live for one more day.

11:08.110 --> 11:09.346
One more day?

11:09.370 --> 11:10.146
What?

11:10.170 --> 11:12.700
You're going to meet him again tomorrow?

11:17.020 --> 11:18.540
Show me the antidote.

11:24.390 --> 11:25.976
Tang Xiao is unscrupulous.

11:26.000 --> 11:27.950
What if this is poison?

11:28.210 --> 11:29.660
Let me smell it.

11:33.890 --> 11:35.340
Skullcap root.

11:35.790 --> 11:36.916
Phellodendron.

11:36.940 --> 11:38.390
Great burdock achene.

11:38.630 --> 11:40.080
And…

11:47.250 --> 11:49.246
Rhododendron molle. Carpesium fruit.

11:49.270 --> 11:50.446
Rhododendron molle?

11:50.470 --> 11:52.110
It's highly toxic.

11:52.260 --> 11:53.756
A proper amount of it

11:53.780 --> 11:55.590
has a mind-calming effect.

11:55.660 --> 11:57.190
Carpesium fruit is the same.

11:57.450 --> 11:59.640
Both of them are detoxifying.

12:03.350 --> 12:04.446
Miss Ke.

12:04.470 --> 12:05.920
Tianhu.

12:06.140 --> 12:07.590
Tianhu.

12:08.350 --> 12:09.800
Miss Ke.

12:09.870 --> 12:11.926
Hang in there. The antidote is coming.

12:11.950 --> 12:13.400
Miss Ke.

12:13.840 --> 12:14.516
Tianhu.

12:14.540 --> 12:15.040
It hurts.

12:15.060 --> 12:16.510
I know.

12:18.710 --> 12:19.846
I...

12:19.870 --> 12:21.230
Am I going to die?

12:21.230 --> 12:21.976
No.

12:22.000 --> 12:23.436
The antidote will be here soon.

12:23.460 --> 12:24.856
Hold on.

12:24.880 --> 12:26.330
Here's the antidote.

12:26.910 --> 12:28.360
Jin.

12:28.950 --> 12:30.400
Give it to me.

12:30.850 --> 12:31.650
Here, Tianhu.

12:31.670 --> 12:33.596
I won't take it.

12:33.620 --> 12:35.296
I'd rather die.

12:35.320 --> 12:36.770
Tianhu.

12:37.750 --> 12:39.200
You must eat it.

12:40.470 --> 12:43.380
Open your mouth.

12:46.510 --> 12:47.686
It hurts.

12:47.710 --> 12:48.686
All right.

12:48.710 --> 12:50.366
All right.

12:50.390 --> 12:51.840
You'll be fine.

12:52.530 --> 12:53.980
You'll be fine.

13:02.780 --> 13:03.926
Look around.

13:03.950 --> 13:05.086
It's only been three days,

13:05.110 --> 13:06.966
but it looks like a tornado has been here.

13:06.990 --> 13:08.440
No one bothers to clean it up?

13:09.170 --> 13:11.290
The staff stayed up for three days,

13:11.600 --> 13:12.726
so once there was no more suspense,

13:12.750 --> 13:14.516
I asked them to go back and rest.

13:14.540 --> 13:16.356
Do you know that kindness is useless on the battlefield

13:16.380 --> 13:17.830
and in business?

13:20.230 --> 13:21.680
My sister told me that,

13:21.870 --> 13:23.390
but I don't agree.

13:24.480 --> 13:28.020
Are you going to plead for Ke Menglan?

13:28.950 --> 13:32.330
You know things were hard for Menglan.

13:33.100 --> 13:35.046
If you want to fire her,

13:35.070 --> 13:36.686
I'll find her somewhere else to stay.

13:36.710 --> 13:38.086
Please don't be hard on her.

13:38.110 --> 13:39.560
Fire her?

13:39.830 --> 13:41.706
Then tell me who will run Liansheng House

13:41.730 --> 13:43.180
for me in the future.

13:44.850 --> 13:46.300
You'll let it slide?

13:49.190 --> 13:51.110
You two are a great match.

13:51.540 --> 13:52.990
Cherish her.

14:25.670 --> 14:27.440
Are you feeling better now?

14:29.400 --> 14:30.850
Let me see.

14:39.430 --> 14:40.276
Her pulse is stable.

14:40.300 --> 14:41.830
She's in the clear now.

14:47.030 --> 14:48.910
Are you still feeling uncomfortable?

14:50.950 --> 14:53.030
I wish I had died.

14:55.750 --> 14:58.390
She keeps saying that.

14:59.850 --> 15:00.556
Don't cry.

15:00.580 --> 15:02.090
Tianhu.

15:03.390 --> 15:04.840
That day...

15:05.690 --> 15:07.140
Forget it.

15:15.300 --> 15:16.750
Jin.

15:17.070 --> 15:18.870
What did you do to Tianhu?

15:19.540 --> 15:21.320
Am I that kind of person?

15:21.510 --> 15:22.936
I heard

15:22.960 --> 15:26.116
that Tang Xiao is marrying Tianhu to Jin.

15:26.140 --> 15:28.190
Miss Ke, stop talking.

15:28.730 --> 15:30.056
Ten Taels of Gold!

15:30.080 --> 15:31.106
What did you do?

15:31.130 --> 15:32.680
I didn't do anything.

15:33.230 --> 15:34.406
Tell me.

15:34.430 --> 15:35.506
Menglan.

15:35.530 --> 15:36.850
How can I explain myself?

15:36.870 --> 15:38.026
Come with me.

15:38.050 --> 15:39.530
Now. Come with me.

15:40.900 --> 15:42.480
I can't explain.

15:42.520 --> 15:43.756
I'm tired. Let's talk tomorrow.

15:43.780 --> 15:45.476
Don't go. Tell me.

15:45.500 --> 15:47.380
What did you do to Tianhu?

15:49.390 --> 15:50.840
Tianhu.

15:51.190 --> 15:53.500
Can you explain things to her for me?

15:53.830 --> 15:55.326
This crazy girl

15:55.350 --> 15:57.300
is capable of anything when she's angry.

16:13.210 --> 16:15.660
Why can't we talk inside?

16:17.860 --> 16:18.886
Yun said

16:18.910 --> 16:20.960
you can still be the manager of Liansheng House.

16:24.670 --> 16:28.070
No boss would use someone who betrayed him.

16:28.680 --> 16:31.030
I think Mr. Yun just didn't want to embarrass you.

16:32.350 --> 16:35.040
After Tianhu recovers, I'll leave

16:36.500 --> 16:39.500
so that you two won't be on bad terms.

16:39.590 --> 16:41.660
You think too much.

16:41.750 --> 16:43.480
Not only did he not blame you,

16:44.870 --> 16:46.850
he also prepared a generous gift for you.

16:55.190 --> 16:56.956
These people are all low-born

16:56.980 --> 16:58.976
and will be sent to brothels and gambling houses.

16:59.000 --> 17:00.286
She's so young.

17:00.150 --> 17:02.960
[15 years ago]

17:00.310 --> 17:01.290
Poor girl.

17:01.310 --> 17:02.760
Menglan.

17:03.310 --> 17:04.899
Stay alive.

17:06.550 --> 17:11.590
After you grow up, do everything it takes to get elevated out of lowly status.

17:13.830 --> 17:15.910
Remember that. Menglan.

17:16.070 --> 17:18.406
-Menglan. -Mother.

17:18.430 --> 17:20.786
Remember, your surname is Ke.

17:20.810 --> 17:24.746
-Menglan. -Remember.

17:24.770 --> 17:27.399
-Mother. -Your surname is Ke.

17:27.820 --> 17:30.260
-Mother. -Menglan.

17:40.710 --> 17:42.430
Actually, Yun

17:44.260 --> 17:45.710
is not narrow-minded.

17:46.210 --> 17:49.440
He's really good at strategies.

17:49.790 --> 17:51.590
He's hard to understand

17:51.670 --> 17:54.546
but not cold-hearted.

17:54.570 --> 17:56.316
When he made plans,

17:56.340 --> 17:57.816
he had our best interests in mind.

17:57.840 --> 17:59.900
He knows what we care about the most.

18:06.670 --> 18:08.120
It turns out

18:09.750 --> 18:12.760
that I'm the most despicable person here.

18:14.690 --> 18:16.640
That's nonsense.

18:17.520 --> 18:18.970
That's true.

18:23.140 --> 18:25.490
I made friends with Miss Shu

18:26.870 --> 18:31.060
and treated Mr. Yun respectfully.

18:32.380 --> 18:34.420
I smiled at everyone.

18:35.650 --> 18:38.150
It seemed that I got along well with everyone.

18:40.280 --> 18:41.730
But in the end,

18:43.220 --> 18:45.460
I betrayed all of them.

18:54.440 --> 18:56.240
Don't be so hard on yourself.

18:57.120 --> 18:58.570
No one blames you.

19:02.900 --> 19:05.420
Can I ask you something?

19:10.170 --> 19:12.580
Has it ever bothered you

19:13.790 --> 19:15.920
that I'm low-born?

19:16.750 --> 19:23.340
It never bothered me, not for a second.

19:23.550 --> 19:25.920
In my heart, you're just Ke Menglan,

19:27.230 --> 19:30.020
the woman I'll protect for the rest of my life.

19:40.410 --> 19:42.686
♫ Waiting for a journey ♫

19:42.710 --> 19:46.100
♫ Where the moon is hidden in a dream ♫

19:43.100 --> 19:44.550
Menglan!

19:47.070 --> 19:49.450
♫ To look back at you among in the sea of people ♫

19:48.610 --> 19:50.710
It has been the chain around my neck for years.

19:49.670 --> 19:52.870
♫ Just like how we first met ♫

19:52.140 --> 19:55.720
But now, it's nothing

19:55.380 --> 19:57.576
♫ When I look at you ♫

19:56.710 --> 19:58.310
compared to our love.

19:57.600 --> 20:02.240
♫ I wonder how can the word "love" be taken lightly ♫

20:02.550 --> 20:05.160
♫ Who was the one who fell deep within ♫

20:02.950 --> 20:04.990
It should've long been burned to ashes.

20:05.290 --> 20:09.140
♫ Only to be disappointed again ♫

20:09.300 --> 20:13.116
♫ There once was ignorance as we smiled gently ♫

20:13.140 --> 20:16.980
♫ Your beauty melted the cold winter ♫

20:17.250 --> 20:21.166
♫ I wish to hold your hand and give my all ♫

20:21.190 --> 20:23.670
♫ And to have each other ♫

20:24.210 --> 20:28.116
♫ As the seasons past, your fragrance makes my heart flutter ♫

20:28.140 --> 20:32.306
♫ A life in the martial world that is always in turmoil ♫

20:32.330 --> 20:38.986
♫ Good times with you seem like a dream, accompanied by the wind ♫

20:39.010 --> 20:43.460
♫ She's gazing at you, untainted ♫

20:43.480 --> 20:46.446
♫ Frost and snow brushed past the eyes and brows ♫

20:46.470 --> 20:49.140
♫ She murmured ♫

20:49.300 --> 20:53.836
♫ An appointment for a lifetime ♫

20:53.860 --> 20:58.570
♫ Hiding a tear ♫

20:59.130 --> 21:02.416
♫ She's unyielding ♫

21:02.440 --> 21:10.060
♫ One journey, one glance, one thought about missing you ♫

22:40.470 --> 22:46.910
[The Luo family's village]

23:06.750 --> 23:07.326
Mr. Tang,

23:07.350 --> 23:09.756
we loaned the Cao Sect 30,000 taels in total.

23:09.780 --> 23:12.840
After paying Mr. Yun off,

23:12.940 --> 23:15.796
we'll only have petty cash left.

23:15.820 --> 23:18.560
We have no more money for the Lingyuan Sect.

23:18.750 --> 23:22.090
Mr. Ye won't be happy about it.

23:30.510 --> 23:32.420
Let the two outside come in.

23:32.790 --> 23:34.240
Yes.

23:35.250 --> 23:44.270
[Liansheng House]

23:47.870 --> 23:49.006
Everyone.

23:49.030 --> 23:52.510
We reopen today. A 10% discount will be offered.

23:54.530 --> 23:58.670
[Open at nine. 10% discount]

23:56.010 --> 24:00.960
Great!

24:07.210 --> 24:10.100
Open all the doors and windows.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.916
Light the incense too.

24:11.940 --> 24:12.756
Go get ready.

24:12.780 --> 24:14.230
Okay.

24:14.790 --> 24:15.796
Use rosin.

24:15.820 --> 24:17.270
It's refreshing.

24:17.830 --> 24:19.280
Yes.

24:20.940 --> 24:22.460
Did you sleep well last night?

24:25.950 --> 24:26.786
Mr. Yun.

24:26.810 --> 24:28.156
Yun.

24:28.180 --> 24:29.636
Didn't you say we'll be closed for a few days?

24:29.660 --> 24:31.180
Why did you reopen so soon?

24:31.220 --> 24:32.670
Menglan is the manager.

24:32.870 --> 24:35.460
She calls the shots.

24:38.590 --> 24:42.190
Running a gambling house is like panning for gold in flowing water.

24:42.510 --> 24:43.916
If we take a break,

24:43.940 --> 24:46.130
we'll miss the gold.

24:47.510 --> 24:49.500
Manager Ke, do you know

24:50.070 --> 24:53.310
that many people here are Tang Xiao's spies?

24:54.670 --> 24:57.520
You may get in trouble for doing this.

25:00.410 --> 25:02.550
Since the competition is over,

25:02.950 --> 25:05.940
Tang Xiao's trusted men will not come back.

25:06.750 --> 25:10.650
Those who stay were just paid to do their job.

25:11.370 --> 25:12.820
They are in no way

25:13.410 --> 25:15.290
more untrustworthy than me.

25:16.310 --> 25:18.320
If you trust me,

25:18.770 --> 25:20.370
please trust them as well.

25:21.670 --> 25:23.056
Manager Ke,

25:23.080 --> 25:24.656
Liansheng House is lucky

25:24.680 --> 25:26.410
to have you as its manager.

25:26.490 --> 25:28.110
I'm lucky to have you work for me.

25:28.640 --> 25:30.410
Thank you for staying.

25:40.670 --> 25:41.846
Where are we going to meet them?

25:41.870 --> 25:43.246
You'll see.

25:43.270 --> 25:44.720
Then what are we waiting for?

25:45.650 --> 25:47.936
You may have to fight tooth and nail today.

25:47.960 --> 25:49.730
Do you need to bring more men?

26:14.030 --> 26:17.050
You said Manager Ke burned that document.

26:17.450 --> 26:18.980
She burned it once she got it.

26:19.280 --> 26:20.736
Was she out of her mind?

26:20.760 --> 26:22.126
With that burned,

26:22.150 --> 26:24.870
she'll be of the low lot for her whole life.

26:25.490 --> 26:27.210
What an interesting woman.

26:27.520 --> 26:29.126
She's staked her whole life

26:29.150 --> 26:31.526
on that guy Su Mingyu.

26:31.550 --> 26:32.966
Menglan is proud.

26:32.990 --> 26:35.396
She probably just didn't want to be trapped by her parentage.

26:35.420 --> 26:37.390
That's a real gamble.

26:37.910 --> 26:40.910
I don't have the guts to do that.

26:41.690 --> 26:43.716
You never risked anything.

26:43.740 --> 26:45.196
Your gambles are all fake.

26:45.220 --> 26:46.646
Jin.

26:46.670 --> 26:48.086
Yun Xiang is scheming.

26:48.110 --> 26:49.886
But has he ever done you wrong?

26:49.910 --> 26:50.916
Girl,

26:50.940 --> 26:52.820
are you blind or stupid?

26:52.870 --> 26:54.206
I'm not the only one he took advantage of.

26:54.230 --> 26:55.860
He used you a lot of times too.

27:03.540 --> 27:04.990
You're right.

27:05.520 --> 27:08.840
It's fair to say that I'm selfish.

27:09.460 --> 27:12.030
But after I met you guys,

27:12.950 --> 27:15.890
I found Jin straightforward, Mingyu sincere,

27:16.290 --> 27:17.990
Manager Ke resilient.

27:22.540 --> 27:23.990
And you...

27:24.630 --> 27:26.080
What?

27:33.490 --> 27:35.960
Anyway, only after I met you guys did I realize

27:36.290 --> 27:38.220
that this is a colorful world

27:38.390 --> 27:39.840
where people care for each other.

27:41.070 --> 27:43.950
I want to be part of this world.

27:44.180 --> 27:45.606
Don't change the subject.

27:45.630 --> 27:47.080
You found me what?

28:02.030 --> 28:03.480
Enough flirting.

28:27.360 --> 28:28.810
Yun Xiang.

28:29.180 --> 28:30.700
You were right about fighting.

28:30.830 --> 28:34.420
But we don't have to fight tooth and nail

28:34.560 --> 28:36.240
to beat those two scumbags.

28:36.560 --> 28:38.010
You're good at using poison,

28:38.070 --> 28:39.630
but poison doesn't work on Meizhu.

28:39.710 --> 28:40.750
If you exchange opponents with Jin…

28:40.750 --> 28:42.200
No way.

28:42.470 --> 28:44.170
I don't beat women.

28:44.830 --> 28:46.710
And I don't fight men.

28:48.140 --> 28:49.990
I'll tell you what I didn't finish

28:50.540 --> 28:51.990
after you come back.

28:53.110 --> 28:54.830
I've been waiting for a long time.

28:54.960 --> 28:56.770
I can wait a bit longer.

29:03.360 --> 29:04.326
Jin.

29:04.350 --> 29:05.860
Clear a path for me.

29:30.790 --> 29:32.240
Hyah!

29:50.850 --> 29:52.546
I told you

29:52.570 --> 29:54.300
I'll kill you.

29:55.020 --> 29:56.470
We'll see about that.

31:24.550 --> 31:25.906
I told you

31:25.930 --> 31:27.546
I'm immune to your poison.

31:27.570 --> 31:29.406
You're indeed invulnerable to poison.

31:29.430 --> 31:32.290
But these darts are not poisoned.

31:32.630 --> 31:35.320
They're laced with herbs that can get your blood flowing.

31:47.350 --> 31:49.960
Most people avoid being hit by my darts,

31:50.150 --> 31:51.910
but you didn't bother to dodge

31:51.910 --> 31:53.706
because you're extraordinarily strong

31:53.730 --> 31:55.076
and can't feel pain.

31:55.100 --> 31:57.990
You can hardly notice that you're bleeding.

32:41.030 --> 32:42.630
You hit me low again.

32:43.030 --> 32:44.840
Try something new.

32:47.020 --> 32:49.380
You fought well, but not well enough.

32:52.390 --> 32:55.230
You'll see

32:55.270 --> 32:58.110
that I fight better than you.

33:32.550 --> 33:35.220
You should've taken my advice.

33:39.100 --> 33:42.510
What's holding you back?

33:43.350 --> 33:44.800
Tianhu remembered

33:45.070 --> 33:47.620
you giving her those beads to suppress the poison.

33:47.820 --> 33:50.180
You said the weak only deserve to grovel.

33:50.750 --> 33:52.540
Does it sound ridiculous

33:52.980 --> 33:54.430
to you now?

33:55.810 --> 33:58.080
I'm controlled by Tang Xiao.

33:58.610 --> 34:00.980
You're controlled by Young Master Xiang.

34:01.290 --> 34:05.530
Both of us are weak.

34:06.390 --> 34:07.840
You're wrong.

34:08.230 --> 34:10.419
Yun Xiang never controls me.

34:11.629 --> 34:13.990
You've bled too much. No one can save you.

34:14.549 --> 34:16.249
Since there's still good in you,

34:16.299 --> 34:17.979
I can give you a quick death.

34:20.370 --> 34:23.090
Only the strong deserve to live.

34:23.580 --> 34:27.010
I don't need your pity.

34:54.589 --> 34:56.176
How many rounds did you fight?

34:56.200 --> 34:57.650
Looks like you had a hard time.

34:59.510 --> 35:02.310
Says someone whose sword was broken in half.

35:05.820 --> 35:07.270
Hold this.

35:15.780 --> 35:17.950
You look better now. Let's go.

35:17.990 --> 35:19.440
Where are we going?

35:19.990 --> 35:21.246
We have a score to settle.

35:21.270 --> 35:22.396
That lackeys are dead.

35:22.420 --> 35:24.100
Who do you think will be the next?

35:29.050 --> 35:31.450
Where is Yun Xiang going to meet Tang Xiao?

35:32.560 --> 35:34.440
You're the coachman. You tell me.

35:34.840 --> 35:36.980
He only told me to go east after leaving the city.

35:39.450 --> 35:41.246
He didn't want me to kill Tang Xiao.

35:41.270 --> 35:43.230
He knew this would happen halfway.

35:43.470 --> 35:44.920
We've been set up!

35:48.480 --> 35:50.170
Stop shaking your head.

36:05.480 --> 36:07.036
What a surprise!

36:07.060 --> 36:08.950
Are you here to check out the view too?

36:09.490 --> 36:11.760
You must have been waiting for me for a long time.

36:12.710 --> 36:13.606
The road ahead is bumpy.

36:13.630 --> 36:15.110
Let's ride.

36:17.030 --> 36:18.176
What?

36:18.200 --> 36:20.116
You planned to meet Tang Xiao without me.

36:20.140 --> 36:21.590
Am I an outsider to you?

36:21.620 --> 36:22.670
We'll be talking about some private matters.

36:22.670 --> 36:24.126
About the Luo family's village, right?

36:24.150 --> 36:25.696
I know something about what happened.

36:25.720 --> 36:26.506
If I go with you,

36:26.530 --> 36:28.366
I can tell you whether he's lying.

36:28.390 --> 36:29.016
Let's go.

36:29.040 --> 36:30.176
Wait for me here.

36:30.200 --> 36:31.650
Okay.

36:56.740 --> 36:58.850
Please have a seat.

37:01.160 --> 37:04.966
Why are you still alive?

37:04.990 --> 37:06.366
It's a long story.

37:06.390 --> 37:08.290
Let's sit down first.

37:11.870 --> 37:12.776
Here. Leave us.

37:12.800 --> 37:13.690
Don't let anyone come close.

37:13.710 --> 37:14.386
Okay.

37:14.410 --> 37:15.416
You're so generous.

37:15.440 --> 37:17.160
Thank you so much.

37:21.070 --> 37:23.180
Nandu has numerous bars and tea houses.

37:24.460 --> 37:26.260
We can meet in any of them.

37:26.890 --> 37:28.210
But I asked to meet you here

37:28.230 --> 37:29.820
because I knew you'd ambush me.

37:30.260 --> 37:31.790
You think you're smart,

37:32.230 --> 37:34.350
but when you're desperate,

37:34.510 --> 37:37.510
you can't even see through such a lousy trick.

37:38.500 --> 37:40.290
You're bluffing.

37:40.630 --> 37:42.486
I don't believe

37:42.510 --> 37:44.030
Zhong and Meizhu

37:44.030 --> 37:46.790
can't beat those two losers working for you.

37:48.520 --> 37:50.430
If I'd known you wouldn't believe me,

37:50.870 --> 37:53.110
I would've brought them along.

37:53.180 --> 37:54.630
But if I had,

37:55.420 --> 37:57.470
I'm afraid you would lose your head

37:57.510 --> 37:59.240
before you even say a word.

38:00.870 --> 38:01.846
Young Master Xiang!

38:01.870 --> 38:04.190
If you want to lead the gambling business in Nandu,

38:04.190 --> 38:05.870
I can step down.

38:05.870 --> 38:08.840
Do you have to push me this hard?

38:13.140 --> 38:15.356
Mr. Tang, do you remember the Luo family's village?

38:15.380 --> 38:16.646
The Luo family's village?

38:16.670 --> 38:19.216
You put me through hell

38:19.240 --> 38:20.690
just to ask about that?

38:25.300 --> 38:26.750
The Luo family's village.

38:26.870 --> 38:28.106
A village near the east coast.

38:28.130 --> 38:29.606
You remember it.

38:29.630 --> 38:31.696
Is it because there's something special about that village?

38:31.720 --> 38:33.570
It's a poor and remote place.

38:34.210 --> 38:37.230
What does that village have to do with you?

38:40.080 --> 38:41.530
Mr. Mo.

38:41.580 --> 38:43.436
You know what happened in that village.

38:43.460 --> 38:45.240
Why don't you tell him?

38:45.870 --> 38:47.606
I only know that village

38:47.630 --> 38:50.276
was rumored to be a pirates' den,

38:50.300 --> 38:51.406
which was not true.

38:51.430 --> 38:53.186
I don't know whether it was true or not.

38:53.210 --> 38:55.066
But all the villagers there

38:55.090 --> 38:57.586
were killed as pirates.

38:57.610 --> 38:58.896
So,

38:58.920 --> 39:00.736
we ordinary people

39:00.760 --> 39:02.866
should never go against the court.

39:02.890 --> 39:04.340
Am I right?

39:05.500 --> 39:07.616
That had nothing to do with you?

39:07.640 --> 39:11.630
What crazy things did Qi Tianfeng say to you?

39:12.240 --> 39:13.286
That matter

39:13.310 --> 39:15.890
truly had nothing to do with me.

39:16.360 --> 39:18.050
You're innocent.

39:18.420 --> 39:19.606
It surprises me.

39:19.630 --> 39:20.550
There's no need for you

39:20.550 --> 39:22.570
to throw shade on me.

39:22.690 --> 39:24.306
I'm not a good person.

39:24.330 --> 39:25.476
But I swear I had nothing to do

39:25.500 --> 39:27.046
with that matter.

39:27.070 --> 39:29.946
If you wouldn't be frank with us here,

39:29.970 --> 39:31.036
it's okay.

39:31.060 --> 39:32.246
We can give you three days.

39:32.270 --> 39:33.126
Within three days,

39:33.150 --> 39:35.306
pay Mr. Yun the 75,000 taels you owe him.

39:35.330 --> 39:37.276
Otherwise, he'll complain to the Chamber of Commerce

39:37.300 --> 39:40.006
and you'll have to pay with your family assets.

39:40.030 --> 39:41.826
Then just tell me

39:41.850 --> 39:43.970
what you want to know.

39:44.050 --> 39:45.890
Everything about the Luo family's village.

39:46.610 --> 39:50.210
Mr. Tang, please tell me everything you know.

39:54.620 --> 39:59.000
Back then, rumor had it that the court was to lift the sea ban.

39:59.100 --> 40:02.006
Every businessman in Nandu

40:02.030 --> 40:05.086
hurried to the east coast to buy land.

40:05.110 --> 40:06.366
Inevitably,

40:06.390 --> 40:07.790
some land was acquired

40:07.790 --> 40:09.350
by force.

40:09.350 --> 40:10.870
You know what I mean, Mr. Mo.

40:10.870 --> 40:12.950
The same tactics were used again and again.

40:14.220 --> 40:15.106
Yes.

40:15.130 --> 40:16.916
Some land was acquired by force,

40:16.940 --> 40:18.840
but slaughtering a village

40:19.270 --> 40:20.796
had never happened before.

40:20.820 --> 40:23.610
I have no idea how that happened.

40:23.760 --> 40:25.846
You know pretty well.

40:25.870 --> 40:28.870
All the money we used to buy land

40:28.870 --> 40:30.336
was borrowed from your bank.

40:30.360 --> 40:32.366
You raked in fortunes

40:32.390 --> 40:36.080
and Guanghui Bank became the largest bank in Nandu.

40:41.020 --> 40:42.530
Just talk about the Luo family's village.

40:50.270 --> 40:53.070
I collaborated with Wen Cong to buy land.

40:53.510 --> 40:55.296
Most landlords there

40:55.320 --> 40:56.896
could be intimidated

40:56.920 --> 40:59.000
into selling us their land.

40:59.110 --> 41:00.756
But the Luo family

41:00.780 --> 41:02.526
said their ancestors' graves were there

41:02.550 --> 41:03.736
and wouldn't relent no matter what we did.

41:03.760 --> 41:06.570
They were dead set on keeping the land.

41:07.510 --> 41:10.390
So you spread rumors that the villagers were pirates

41:10.450 --> 41:12.360
and bribed the soldiers to slaughter the village.

41:12.550 --> 41:13.190
In that way,

41:13.190 --> 41:16.076
you didn't even have to pay for the land.

41:16.100 --> 41:18.710
I didn't do that.

41:18.860 --> 41:21.756
It was a guy working for us. We called him…

41:21.780 --> 41:23.296
Sheriff Liu.

41:23.320 --> 41:24.966
He said to us

41:24.990 --> 41:26.956
that he'd help us get the land

41:26.980 --> 41:28.686
even if he had to kill the entire village.

41:28.710 --> 41:32.850
No one expected him to really do that.

41:33.470 --> 41:34.920
Sheriff Liu?

41:36.190 --> 41:37.830
Where is he now?

41:39.750 --> 41:42.586
He got a promotion for killing the pirates

41:42.610 --> 41:44.246
in the Luo family's village.

41:44.270 --> 41:46.646
In less than half a year, he was sent to the front line

41:46.670 --> 41:47.606
in Fujian

41:47.630 --> 41:50.216
with a whole battalion.

41:50.240 --> 41:54.430
There, he encountered true pirates and got killed.

41:57.180 --> 41:58.630
So,

41:58.930 --> 42:00.900
he just took all the proof to the grave.

42:01.730 --> 42:03.330
Unfortunately, yes.

42:14.870 --> 42:18.150
Who spread the rumor about lifting the sea ban?

42:19.940 --> 42:23.506
I can't answer that question.

42:23.530 --> 42:25.050
Who can?

42:26.230 --> 42:28.286
If I tell you,

42:28.310 --> 42:30.980
the 70,000 taels I owe you…

42:31.230 --> 42:33.230
I can give you one more week without interest.

42:34.510 --> 42:35.960
To get the answer,

42:36.510 --> 42:38.430
you should ask your friend,

42:38.890 --> 42:41.740
the other owner of Liansheng House,

42:42.270 --> 42:44.470
Su Mingyu.

42:47.470 --> 42:49.286
He was just around ten years old at that time.

42:49.310 --> 42:50.486
It had nothing to do with him.

42:50.510 --> 42:52.460
It was his father.

42:53.640 --> 42:57.146
The one who led us to buy land

42:57.170 --> 42:59.406
was his father,

42:59.430 --> 43:05.940
Su Linghe, a member of Nandu Chamber of Commerce.

43:19.220 --> 43:21.636
Do you have any evidence to back up your story?

43:21.660 --> 43:22.446
The deeds.

43:22.470 --> 43:24.726
The deeds to all the land we bought

43:24.750 --> 43:25.950
were recorded

43:25.970 --> 43:27.946
on the ledger

43:27.970 --> 43:30.830
of the Chamber of Commerce.
